sequenceDiagram
  participant E1 as Edge 1 - HP Dijaga
  participant E2 as Edge 2 - HP Pemilik
  participant Broker as Cloud MQTT Broker
  participant D as Detector Service
  D->>Broker: SUBSCRIBE edge/+/telemetry
  E2->>Broker: SUBSCRIBE alerts
  E2->>Broker: PUBLISH edge2 motion (still)
  E1->>Broker: PUBLISH edge1 motion (moving)
  Broker-->>D: Telemetry from both devices
  D->>D: Compute anomaly via rules.py
  D->>Broker: PUBLISH alerts
  Broker-->>E2: ALERT suspected movement
